 111:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  *
 112:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  * This message provides a mechanism to acknowledge the result
 113:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  * of those BVLL service requests that require an acknowledgment,
 114:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  * whether successful (ACK) or unsuccessful (NAK).
 115:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  *
 116:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  * @param pdu - buffer to store the encoding
 117:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  * @param pdu_size - size of the buffer to store encoding
