 123:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  * BVLC Function:         1-octet   X'00'   BVLC-Result
 124:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  * BVLC Length:           2-octets  X'0009' Length of the BVLL message
 125:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  * Source-Virtual-Address 3-octets
 126:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  * Result Code:           2-octets  X'0000' Successful completion
 127:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  *                                  X'0030' Address-Resolution NAK
 128:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  *                                  X'0060' Virtual-Address-Resolution NAK
 129:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  *                                  X'0090' Register-Foreign-Device NAK
 130:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  *                                  X'00A0' Delete-Foreign-Device-Table-Entry NAK
 131:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  *                                  X'00C0' Distribute-Broadcast-To-Network NAK
 132:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  */
