 863:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c **** /** Encode the BVLC Address-Resolution-Ack message
 864:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  *
 865:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  * This message is the reply to either the Address-Resolution or
 866:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  * the Forwarded-Address-Resolution messages.
