1403:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  *
1404:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  * This message provides a mechanism whereby a foreign device
1405:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  * shall cause a BBMD to distribute a Forwarded-NPDU
1406:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  * BVLC to the local multicast domain, to all BBMD’s configured
1407:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  * in the BBMD’s BDT, and to all foreign devices in the
1408:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  * BBMD’s FDT.
1409:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  *
1410:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  * @param pdu - buffer to store the encoding
