1418:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  * BVLC Type:                   1-octet   X'82'   BVLL for BACnet/IPv6
1419:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  * BVLC Function:               1-octet   X'0C'   Original-Unicast-NPDU
1420:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  * BVLC Length:                 2-octets  L       Length of the BVLL message
1421:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  * Original-Source-Virtual-Address:      3-octets
1422:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/bvlc6.c ****  * BACnet NPDU from Originating Device:  Variable length
